WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Start with x = (3,4). ||x||₂ = 5.
Two coordinates define a vector. The norm measures its length.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Keep the direction u = (1,1). uᵀx = 7 · uᵀu = 2.
The line contains multiples of u. How much of x lies along it?

3
00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Choose coefficient c = 7/2. p = c u = (3.5,3.5).
Projection lands on the line. It is the closest point to x.

4
00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
What could not be represented?. r = x − p = (−0.5,0.5).
uᵀr = 0: the residual is orthogonal. x = p + r.
